{
  "name": "Jira Production Bug - Automated RCA to Google Sheets and Excel",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 500,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Setup before activation\n1. Upload **VWO-49_RCA_Template.xlsx** to Google Drive and convert it to a native Google Sheet. Rename its first tab to **RCA Summary**.\n2. Create a Google Sheet for the audit log with a tab named **RCA_Audit** and headers:\n`jira_key | issue_fingerprint | jira_updated_at | google_sheet_file_id | google_sheet_url | rca_version | processing_status | processed_at | execution_id | excel_file_url`\n3. In **Workflow Configuration**, replace every placeholder ID, domain, JQL, and optionally the model.\n4. Select credentials on all Jira, Google, and OpenAI nodes. Jira credentials need issue/webhook access. Google OAuth needs Sheets and Drive read/write scopes.\n5. Run the Manual Trigger once, inspect the generated Sheet/XLSX, then activate the Jira Trigger.\n6. Configure an n8n Error Workflow for operational alerts.\n\nThe production trigger listens for create/update events, then re-checks the JQL before processing."
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1180,
        -520
      ],
      "id": "86e076c7-ab80-4cd8-a19d-8c1c71dedb9d",
      "name": "Setup Instructions"
    },
    {
